# War Machine, Legacy of Iron: "At the beginning of combat on your turn, another target creature you control gets +X/+0
# until end of turn, where X is War Machine's power." On turn 1 his power is 1, so Memnite (his only legal target: he is
# not "another") gets +1/+0 for that turn only. On turn 3 Rancor makes him 3/3 before combat, so Memnite gets +3/+0.

